# Ignoring `.vscode/` itself (rather than `.vscode/*`) would make git
# skip the directory entirely and never evaluate the negation below —
# a real bug caught while committing this branch. Ignore its contents
# individually instead so the shared task config can be un-ignored.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/tasks.json
*.swp
*.swo

